Backstage, throughout tonight's concert, Zeitels will use an Endoscope to examine Tyler's voice box up close.

190
00:21:44,340 --> 00:21:50,680
Try not to touch the sides. Yep. Got it. Great Stephen.

191
00:22:01,020 --> 00:22:02,020
It's a rare insight into what goes on in a high, a high performance singer.

192
00:22:02,690 --> 00:22:03,360
Real-time measures of a performer who is at the top of his game, doing a live performance in front of thousands of people.

193
00:22:12,370 --> 00:22:21,700
That's at first hasn't been done before.

194
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:28,050
To produce these kinds of sounds,

195
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:35,390
Tyler's vocal cords are slamming together an average of 170 times a second.

196
00:22:36,060 --> 00:22:39,060
That's more than half a million times during the course of a concert

197
